{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id176306356"}, "name":{"label":"CandiedGold"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-19T15:34:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"1618481964"}, "title":{"label":"Best in Class!"}, "content":{"label":"Before settling on Overcast I tried nearly every podcast app out there!\n\nThe free version of Overcast is functionally solid but the advertisements really detract from the premium feel. I didn't spend big money on a flash new iPhone to be plagued with ads so I took the plunge and invested in Overcast Premium. At $12USD per year it is expensive but provides an Ad free experience and offers a few other minor tweaks like a choice of icons and an option to upload your own content\n\nSome killer features of Overcast include Smart Speed which cuts out silences in podcasts, Smart Voice which emphasises voice playback and Apple Watch playback support!\n\nA must have app for podcast listeners.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
