{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id150996311"}, "name":{"label":"OysteinHK"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-04-21T14:58:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1"}, "id":{"label":"1594411225"}, "title":{"label":"Not longer usable"}, "content":{"label":"In the beginning this app was working flawlessly and was the best podcast app on the market, by far. Unfortunately a couple of months ago it started bugging on me, crashing often and I had to press play 3-4 times before it started playing the podcasts. It was annoying, but not crippling, I was still enjoying the app. However, with the latest update the play button completely stopped working, I press play and it says that's is playing but the time is not progressing and no sound. I have tried reinstalling, soft and hard restarts on both the app and phone, but no luck. I have the latest iOS and iPhone 6", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
